Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-tearfree-amdgpu
Version: 1.6-1
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting, devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-atomic
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Transitional package for devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting
 This package removes the old X11 device section
 /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/20-amdgpu.conf and pulls in
 devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting and
 devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-atomic. The GPU now uses the
 modesetting driver instead of the amdgpu DDX, and variable refresh rate
 is no longer enabled; install devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-vrr for
 it. It can be removed safely.
